### Get all reservations
GET {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get all reservations paged
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?pageNumber=0&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get all reservations filtered by venue
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?venueId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get reservation by ID (Happy Path)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get reservation by ID (404 Error Path)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a reservation (Happy Path)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "venueId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-09-25T12:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-09-25T13:00:00",
  "maxParticipants": 10
}

### Create a reservation (400 Validation Error Path)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": null,
  "venueId": null,
  "startTime": null,
  "endTime": null,
  "maxParticipants": -5
}

### Create a reservation with non-existent resource (400/404 Error Path)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 999999,
  "venueId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-09-25T12:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-09-25T13:00:00",
  "maxParticipants": 10
}

### Create a reservation with non-existent venue (400/404 Error Path)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "venueId": 999999,
  "startTime": "2026-09-25T14:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-09-25T15:00:00",
  "maxParticipants": 10
}

### Create an overlapping reservation (400 Error Path)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "venueId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-09-25T10:30:00",
  "endTime": "2026-09-25T11:30:00",
  "maxParticipants": 10
}

### Cancel a reservation (Happy Path)
DELETE {{host}}/api/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel a reservation (404 Error Path)
DELETE {{host}}/api/reservations/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}